l, "gloss": null}, {"text": "غَٰوِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:16", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/970.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Now, because Thou hast sent me astray, verily I shall lurk in ambush for them on Thy Right Path.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Öyleyse, dedi, beni azdırmana karşılık, and içerim ki, ben de onlar(ı saptırmak) için senin doğru yolunun üstüne oturacağım.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولا تو قسم اس کی کہ تو نے مجھے گمراہ کیا میں ضرور تیرے سیدھے راستہ پر ان کی تاک میں بیٹھوں گا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Iblis menjawab: \"Karena Engkau telah menghukum saya tersesat, saya benar-benar akan (menghalang-halangi) mereka dari jalan Engkau yang lurus,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَبِمَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَغْوَيْتَنِى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6354542592d34c8b3319.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you misled me", "bs": "zaveo si me", "tr": "beni saptırdın", "fr": "tu m'as égaré", "id": "kamu telah menyesatkanku", "ur": "تم نے مجھے گمراہ کیا", "bn": "তুমি আমাকে বিভ্রান্ত করেছ", "fa": "مرا گمراه کردی"}}, {"text": "لَأَقْعُدَنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صِرَٰطَكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "38:82", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4052.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Then, by Thy might, I surely will beguile them every one,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İblis: \"Öyle ise izzet ve şerefine yemin ederim ki, ben onların hepsini mutlaka aldatır, saptırırım.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولا تیری عزت کی قسم ضرور میں ان سب کو گمراہ کردوں گا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Iblis menjawab: \"Demi kekuasaan Engkau aku akan menyesatkan mereka semuanya,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَبِعِزَّتِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَأُغْوِيَنَّهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ac2482e928fbe964bc61.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sigurno ću ih zavesti", "en": "I will surely lead them astray", "tr": "onları mutlaka saptıracağım", "fr": "je les égarerai certes", "id": "sungguh aku akan menyesatkan mereka", "ur": "میں ضرور انہیں گمراہ کروں گا", "bn": "আমি অবশ্যই তাদের পথভ্রষ্ট করব", "fa": "قطعاً آنان را گمراه خواهم کرد"}}, {"text": "أَجْمَعِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "أَغْوَيْتَنِى", "count": 2, "first": "7:16", "audio": "audio/6354542592d34c8b3319.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["ana"]}], "gloss": {"en": "you misled me", "bs": "zaveo si me", "tr": "beni saptırdın", "fr": "tu m'as égaré", "id": "kamu telah menyesatkanku", "ur": "تم نے مجھے گمراہ کیا", "bn": "তুমি আমাকে বিভ্রান্ত করেছ", "fa": "مرا گمراه کردی"}}, {"arabic": "يُغْوِيَكُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "11:34", "audio": "audio/62064ffeba6794619d4c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it misleads you (all)", "bs": "zavodi vas", "tr": "sizi saptırır", "fr": "qu'il vous égare", "id": "dia menyesatkan kalian", "ur": "وہ تم سب کو گمراہ کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে তোমাদের বিভ্রান্ত